  itemName: Zeek Dober
  desp: The Zeekdober was designed for high-speed strike and recon operations under
    direct control of the Emperor. With a maximum speed of 350 km/h, it was, for
    its time, an exceptionally fast Zoid. Additionally, the Zoid's armour and systems
    help mask it from detection, making it a very elusive target. The combination
    of speed and stealth allows the Zeekdober to charge in, attack its target, and
    escape before the enemy can react.
